<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Web Projects · Vadym Rogynskyi</title>
<meta name="description" content="Interactive websites built by Vadym Rogynskyi.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@700;800&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--bg:#F2F3F5;--surface:#fff;--ink:#14171F;--muted:#5D6472;--line:#DDE0E6;--accent:#2350E6;
  --display:"Barlow Condensed","Arial Narrow",sans-serif;--body:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#0E1117;--surface:#171B23;--ink:#E9ECF2;--muted:#9AA2B1;--line:#283040;--accent:#5C82FF}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);line-height:1.55}
.wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px clamp(16px,4vw,32px) 64px}
.lbl{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,8vw,4.8rem);line-height:.9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:8px 0 14px}
h1 span{color:var(--accent)}
.intro{color:var(--muted);max-width:58ch;margin:0 0 36px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:18px}
a.card{display:grid;gap:10px;align-content:start;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s}
a.card:hover,a.card:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-2px);outline:none}
.swatch{height:6px;border-radius:3px}
.card h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:1.9rem;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;margin:0}
.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
.go{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
footer{margin-top:48px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="wrap">
  <span class="lbl">Vadym Rogynskyi</span>
  <h1>Web <span>Projects</span></h1>
  <p class="intro">Interactive sites I've designed and built: a 10K training plan, a pace-planning model, a 3D dive to the bottom of the ocean, a buy-vs-rent advisor, a savings-goal tracker and a habit tracker.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="road-to-the-10k/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2350E6,#E0453A)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">Training plan</span>
      <h2>Road to the 10K</h2>
      <p>A 7-week plan with a race-day countdown, personal pace calculator, weekly checklists and a race-day pacing table.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="pace-gap-planner/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2a78d6,#eb6834)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">Interactive model</span>
      <h2>Pace Gap Planner</h2>
      <p>Move the sliders to see how much pace you need to cut each week to hit a goal time, and whether there's enough time.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="ten-kilometres-down/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6FE3F2,#FFB65C)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">3D experience</span>
      <h2>Ten Kilometres Down</h2>
      <p>Scroll through the five layers of the ocean to the bottom of the Mariana Trench, with a live submersible readout.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="first-paycheck-simulator/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1F8A5B,#C93B55)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">Personal finance</span>
      <h2>First Paycheck Simulator</h2>
      <p>Set your pay, rent, spending and student loan, then see when you'd be debt-free and your net worth over ten years.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="settle/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3B7A57,#D9A441)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">Housing</span>
      <h2>Settle</h2>
      <p>A buy-vs-rent advisor across 70 US cities, sized to your household, income, down payment and how long you'll stay.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="savings-atlas/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#E07A3F,#2F8F83)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">Savings goals</span>
      <h2>Savings Atlas</h2>
      <p>Track savings goals with progress bars, work out how much to put away each month, and read a field guide to saving well.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="habit-ledger/">
      <div class="swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8C6A3F,#3F8C6A)"></div>
      <span class="lbl">Habits</span>
      <h2>Habit Ledger</h2>
      <p>Add your habits, check off what you kept each day and see what's still to do.</p>
      <span class="go">Open site →</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <footer>Built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript. Ten Kilometres Down uses three.js.</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
